  "releaseNotes": "- feat(pool): Support config-based options in AddRabbitMqPool (now supports IConfiguration binding)\n\t\t\t- Added new AddRabbitMqPool overload to bind RabbitMqConnectionPoolOptions from IConfiguration section by name\n\t\t\t- Old overload with Action<RabbitMqConnectionPoolOptions> is still available for code-based setup\n\t\t\t- Updated sample client to use IConfiguration / appsettings.json instead of hardcoded RabbitMQ settings\n\t\t\t- Refactored Program.Main to async, added a stress test function for pool/channel concurrency\n\t\t\t- Cleaned up DI setup, improved code readability, removed commented code and unused usings",
